  "body": "Welcome to 2/20 Hutchinsons Road, Bucklands Beach, Auckland – a fantastic opportunity to secure a well-presented home in one of East Auckland’s most desirable seaside suburbs.\r\n\r\nThis delightful 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom home offers comfortable, low-maintenance living, perfect for first-home buyers, downsizers, or savvy investors. Built in the 1980s, the property features a practical layout with approx 60 m² floor area, complemented by two car spaces for added convenience.\r\n\r\nConstructed with weatherboard exterior and a steel roof, the home combines durability with classic appeal. Its easy-care nature makes it ideal for busy lifestyles or those looking for a lock-and-leave option.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n*2 spacious bedrooms\r\n*1 well-appointed bathroom\r\n*2 car parks\r\n*Solid 1980s construction\r\n*Low-maintenance living\r\n*Zoned for excellent schools\r\n\r\nPrime Location:\r\n\r\n*Positioned in a highly sought-after area, this home is within zone for top local schools including,\r\n*Pakuranga College\r\n*Macleans Primary School\r\n*Howick Intermediate\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of nearby beaches, parks, shopping centres, and public transport, all while living in a peaceful, family-friendly neighbourhood—with Pak’nSave and Woolworths conveniently located just across the road.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re looking to step onto the property ladder, downsize, or invest, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nAct quickly – homes in Bucklands Beach are always in high demand!",
